// mau_inventory.mau —— 库存管理（T4 模块谱案例 3：状态机四态 + 测量采样 + 容量/空库守卫 + 信号竞争压测台）
// 模式：FireStockIn/Out(amount) 增减库存 → 状态刷新律裁决（测量先行 1 帧延迟 + 声明序兜底）→ 拒绝路径守卫
// 压测点：容量=1 极限 / 同帧多信号竞争（声明序消费）/ 出入库长跑 / 空库出库-满库入库拒绝
// 状态刷新纪律（2026-08-13 修复轮）：
//   操作律只改 box；状态刷新由刷新律裁决——测量先行（帧首采样旧 level）→ 状态刷新延迟 1 帧；
//   声明序兜底：T_ToFull → T_ToEmpty → T_RefreshEmpty → T_RefreshLow（满/空优先，恢复兜底）
//   入库后置命题 P_LevelChanged（状态保持 1 帧）——避免旧 P_Empty 测量误触发 T_ToEmpty（压测台发现 #2）
§'Mau' 2.0
§'Mau.Runtime' 2.0
§'S_Inv' = { 'Normal', 'LowStock', 'OutOfStock', 'Full' }
§$'capacity', 'lowThreshold'
§'P_StockIn', 'P_StockOut'
§⇐ 'P_StockIn'['amount']
§⇐ 'P_StockOut'['amount']
§'P_NotFull', 'P_Empty', 'P_Full', 'P_IsLow'
§'P_LevelChanged'

// 测量采样：容量/空库/低库存三条件（感知与决策分离——帧首采样）
§'M_CapOK'[ω=1]: 'P_NotFull' := 'data.box_less'["inv", "level", 'capacity']
§'M_Empty'[ω=1]: 'P_Empty' := 'data.box_less'["inv", "level", 1]
§'M_Full'[ω=1]: 'P_Full' := 'data.box_is'["inv", "level", 'capacity']
§'M_Low'[ω=1]: 'P_IsLow' := 'data.box_less'["inv", "level", 'lowThreshold']

// 入库：容量守卫（测量 P_NotFull——满库拒绝）→ level += amount → P_LevelChanged（状态保持 1 帧，防旧测量误刷新）
§'T_StockIn': 'P_StockIn' ∧ 'P_NotFull' + 'data.box_get'["inv", "level", 0] + 'math.add'['value', 'amount'] + 'data.box_set'["inv", "level", 'sum'] → 'P_LevelChanged'

// 出库（三条律按状态分派——P7 声明序消费；OutOfStock 时全部不命中 → 空库出库拒绝，信号滞留）→ 后置 Normal
§'T_StockOutN': 'P_StockOut' ∧ 'S_Inv' = 'Normal' + 'data.box_get'["inv", "level", 0] + 'math.sub'['value', 'amount'] + 'data.box_set'["inv", "level", 'difference'] → 'S_Inv' = 'Normal'
§'T_StockOutL': 'P_StockOut' ∧ 'S_Inv' = 'LowStock' + 'data.box_get'["inv", "level", 0] + 'math.sub'['value', 'amount'] + 'data.box_set'["inv", "level", 'difference'] → 'S_Inv' = 'Normal'
§'T_StockOutF': 'P_StockOut' ∧ 'S_Inv' = 'Full' + 'data.box_get'["inv", "level", 0] + 'math.sub'['value', 'amount'] + 'data.box_set'["inv", "level", 'difference'] → 'S_Inv' = 'Normal'

// 状态刷新（测量先行值——延迟 1 帧生效；声明序：满/空优先，恢复兜底）
§'T_ToFull': 'P_Full' ∧ 'S_Inv' = 'Normal' ∨ 'P_Full' ∧ 'S_Inv' = 'LowStock' ∨ 'P_Full' ∧ 'S_Inv' = 'OutOfStock' → 'S_Inv' = 'Full'
§'T_ToEmpty': 'P_Empty' ∧ 'S_Inv' = 'Normal' ∨ 'P_Empty' ∧ 'S_Inv' = 'LowStock' ∨ 'P_Empty' ∧ 'S_Inv' = 'Full' → 'S_Inv' = 'OutOfStock'
§'T_RefreshEmpty': 'S_Inv' = 'OutOfStock' + 'data.box_is'["inv", "level", 0] → 'S_Inv' = 'OutOfStock' | 'S_Inv' = 'Normal'
§'T_RefreshLow': 'S_Inv' = 'Normal' ∨ 'S_Inv' = 'LowStock' + 'data.box_get'["inv", "level", 0] + 'math.is_less'['value', 'lowThreshold'] → 'S_Inv' = 'LowStock' | 'S_Inv' = 'Normal'
